type: software
title: "Constrained Generation Library"
abstract: "A structured-generation library built from scratch in Python: compiles a JSON Schema into a finite automaton and masks a model's tokens so output is schema-valid by construction (100% valid JSON across any model versus 0% unconstrained)."
